  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27f18eaebecc318e",
      "translationZh": "🤗 Transformers 提供了涵盖多个领域和任务的众多最新前沿（SoTA）模型。要让这些模型发挥最佳性能，就需要针对推理速度和内存使用进行优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70a8e80ef51b5ee7",
      "translationZh": "🤗 Hugging Face 生态系统恰好提供了这样开箱即用且易于使用的优化工具，可以广泛应用于库中的所有模型。只需额外添加几行代码，就能轻松减少内存占用并改善推理性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "281beec5748220a1",
      "translationZh": "在这篇实操教程中，我将演示如何通过三项简单的优化来优化 Bark，这是一个受 🤗 Transformers 支持的文本转语音（TTS）模型。这些优化仅依赖 🤗 生态系统中的 Transformers、Optimum 和 Accelerate 库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adff79a1928297f9",
      "translationZh": "本教程还将演示如何对未经优化的模型及其不同优化版本进行基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "680d36eb9e1480ac",
      "translationZh": "如果想查看解释较少但包含全部代码的精简版教程，请参阅配套的 Google Colab。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b30140ca09c34cc",
      "translationZh": "这篇博客文章的结构如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acb6d1b9686adba7",
      "translationZh": "回顾 Bark 架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c049ec8a0d22f40",
      "translationZh": "概述不同的优化技术及其优势",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1493d027676b48fc",
      "translationZh": "展示基准测试结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "911bac8015ef71fb",
      "translationZh": "Bark 架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eab7502ead66638f",
      "translationZh": "Bark 是 Suno AI 在 suno-ai/bark 中提出的一款基于 Transformer 的文本转语音模型。它能够生成各种音频输出，包括语音、音乐、背景噪声和简单的音效。此外，它还可以生成笑声、叹息声和啜泣声等非言语交流声音。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "052236a86a00bdab",
      "translationZh": "从 v4.31.0 起，🤗 Transformers 就已支持 Bark！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb3fa0f27a8507b8",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这里试用 Bark，探索它的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33e12d5098f7f451",
      "translationZh": "Bark 由 4 个主要模型组成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e05210910accffb9",
      "translationZh": "BarkSemanticModel（也称为“text”模型）：一个因果自回归 Transformer 模型，以词元化后的文本作为输入，预测能够捕捉文本含义的语义文本词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c6aed9854ab78b4",
      "translationZh": "BarkCoarseModel（也称为“粗粒度声学”模型）：一种因果自回归 Transformer，以 BarkSemanticModel 模型的结果作为输入。它旨在预测 EnCodec 所需的前两个音频码本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a752b92dfb9a5833",
      "translationZh": "BarkFineModel（“细粒度声学”模型）：这次采用的是非因果自编码器 Transformer，它根据前面各码本嵌入之和，迭代预测最后几个码本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "666a293b3cdf7bc2",
      "translationZh": "在预测出 EncodecModel 的所有码本通道后，Bark 使用它来解码输出音频数组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3c59056c4757026",
      "translationZh": "截至撰写本文时，Bark 有两个可用的检查点，分别为较小版本和较大版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "746d4675e139b79c",
      "translationZh": "加载模型及其处理器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87385ef6f50bc195",
      "translationZh": "可以使用 Hugging Face Hub 上的预训练权重加载 Bark 的小型和大型预训练检查点。你可以根据想要使用的检查点大小更改 repo-id。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc55412541771266",
      "translationZh": "我们默认使用小型检查点，以保持较快的运行速度。不过，你可以将 \"suno/bark-small\" 替换为 \"suno/bark\"，尝试使用大型检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86ae7688fd5ed294",
      "translationZh": "将模型放到加速设备上，以充分发挥这些优化技术的作用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80c8818d666c27bd",
      "translationZh": "加载处理器，它将负责分词以及可选的说话人嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "599d2d099025508c",
      "translationZh": "优化技术",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19df63a1683a8c46",
      "translationZh": "在本节中，我们将探索如何使用 🤗 Optimum 和 🤗 Accelerate 库的现成功能，以极少的代码改动来优化 Bark 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9cfc6f92e2398c3b",
      "translationZh": "一些准备工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffb8a96e4439c8e1",
      "translationZh": "让我们准备好输入，并定义一个函数，用于测量 Bark 生成方法的延迟和 GPU 显存占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4758a8d2ebe69f5d",
      "translationZh": "测量延迟和 GPU 显存占用需要使用特定的 CUDA 方法。我们定义一个实用函数，用于测量模型在推理时的延迟和 GPU 显存占用。为确保准确反映这些指标，我们会在指定的运行次数 nb_loops 内取平均值：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6f781d83963d5445",
      "translationZh": "基准情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db1b28b2a795eaf5",
      "translationZh": "在引入任何优化之前，让我们先测量基线模型的性能，并听一听生成的示例。我们将对模型进行五轮基准测试，并报告各项指标的平均值：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34d0273539765329",
      "translationZh": "现在，听听输出的音频：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61e050c71a34a73c",
      "translationZh": "输出听起来是这样的（下载音频）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2088e41830a5c1d4",
      "translationZh": "重要说明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "038db7c243b900e0",
      "translationZh": "这里的迭代次数实际上相当少。要准确衡量和比较结果，应将其增加到至少 100 次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56e4eb0bfd87df1e",
      "translationZh": "增加 nb_loops 之所以重要，一个主要原因是：即使输入固定不变，不同迭代生成的语音时长也会有很大差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2656721c5f9d90df",
      "translationZh": "这带来的一个后果是，measure_latency_and_memory_use 测得的延迟可能并不能反映优化技术的实际性能！这篇博文末尾的基准测试报告了 100 次迭代的平均结果，能够真实反映模型的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f74445ff31b759b",
      "translationZh": "Better Transformer 是 🤗 Optimum 的一项功能，可在底层执行内核融合。这意味着模型的某些运算将在 GPU 上得到更好的优化，最终使模型运行得更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa7bea8c87357638",
      "translationZh": "更具体地说，🤗 Transformers 支持的大多数模型都依赖注意力机制，这使它们能够在生成输出时有选择地关注输入中的某些部分。这让模型能够有效处理长程依赖，并捕捉数据中复杂的上下文关系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4863d8b19fedc87a",
      "translationZh": "通过一种名为 Flash Attention 的技术，可以大幅优化朴素的注意力计算方法。这项技术由 Dao 等作者于 2022 年提出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8262392877f3cd20",
      "translationZh": "Flash Attention 是一种更快、更高效的注意力计算算法，它结合了传统方法（如分块和重计算），以尽可能减少内存使用并提高速度。与以往的算法不同，Flash Attention 将内存占用随序列长度的增长关系从二次方降为线性，因此特别适用于注重内存效率的应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1e6ecf4d2c87d87",
      "translationZh": "原来，🤗 Better Transformer 开箱即用地支持 Flash Attention！只需一行代码，即可将模型导出为 🤗 Better Transformer 并启用 Flash Attention：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61e050c71a34a73c",
      "translationZh": "输出听起来是这样的（下载音频）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86af14d0e0dd8266",
      "translationZh": "它能带来什么好处？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a17ee1bf20921ca",
      "translationZh": "不会出现性能下降，这意味着你可以获得与不使用此功能时完全相同的结果，同时速度提升 20% 到 30%！想了解更多？请参阅这篇博文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "21f8646afc7b6074",
      "translationZh": "2. 半精度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ac3d916e68bcaf0",
      "translationZh": "大多数 AI 模型通常使用一种称为单精度浮点数的存储格式，即 fp32。这在实际中意味着什么？每个数字都使用 32 位来存储。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6ad540bb2adf6bc",
      "translationZh": "因此，你可以选择使用 16 位来编码这些数字，也就是采用所谓的半精度浮点数格式，即 fp16，这样存储空间就只需原来的一半！不仅如此，你还能获得推理加速！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e762febe85e3532f",
      "translationZh": "当然，这也会带来轻微的性能下降，因为模型内部运算的精度不如使用 fp32 时高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb185f5dd56255e3",
      "translationZh": "只需在 BarkModel.from_pretrained(...) 这一行中添加 torch_dtype=torch.float16，就可以用半精度加载 🤗 Transformers 模型！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a980b4dc5edbf2b",
      "translationZh": "换句话说：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61e050c71a34a73c",
      "translationZh": "输出听起来是这样的（下载音频）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86af14d0e0dd8266",
      "translationZh": "它能带来什么好处？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d766414b1eb22f76",
      "translationZh": "在性能略有下降的情况下，您可以将内存占用减少 50%，并将速度提升 5%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "25f5f40dff49c847",
      "translationZh": "3. CPU 卸载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64e8da0569a2f66c",
      "translationZh": "正如本手册第一节所述，Bark 由 4 个子模型组成，在音频生成过程中，这些子模型会被依次调用。换句话说，当一个子模型正在使用时，其他子模型都处于空闲状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a2aa86c9b6a6e22",
      "translationZh": "为什么这是个问题？GPU 显存在 AI 中十分宝贵，因为在其中执行运算的速度最快，而且它往往是瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6274fed6f8882528",
      "translationZh": "一个简单的解决方案是，在子模型不活跃时将其从 GPU 卸载。这种操作称为 CPU 卸载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d146d52a3806227",
      "translationZh": "好消息：Bark 的 CPU 卸载功能已集成到 🤗 Transformers 中，只需一行代码即可使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7fce57db502b359",
      "translationZh": "你只需确保已安装 🤗 Accelerate！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
