    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f3924d91b124464",
      "translationZh": "只需付出速度略微下降（10%）的代价，就能大幅减少内存占用（60% 🤯）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dbd29525be3bd29",
      "translationZh": "启用此功能后，bark-large 的内存占用现在仅为 2GB，而非 5GB。这与 bark-small 的内存占用相同！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76b2dcfa5fda3177",
      "translationZh": "还想进一步降低？启用 fp16 后，内存占用甚至能降至 1GB。我们将在下一节中实际演示！",
