    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f472e2133611fa36",
      "translationZh": "它衡量的是每秒生成的样本数。这一次，计算时会考虑批大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
