      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05a0e930c70c6935",
      "translationZh": "换句话说，它等于 nbLoops∗batchSizeelapsedTime\\frac{nbLoops*batchSize}{elapsedTime}elapsedTimenbLoops∗batchSize​。",
